</style></head><body>
<h1 aria-label="Mahfuj’s Trading Log"><span id="ty">MAHFUJ TRADING LOG</span></h1>
<div class="card two" style="grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr"><div><label>Month</label><select id="msel"></select></div><div><label>&nbsp;</label><button class="reset" id="newm" style="margin:0;width:100%">+ New month</button></div></div>
<div class="card"><label>Month name (rename any time)</label><input id="mname" type="text"></div>
<div id="dls" style="margin-bottom:10px"><button class="reset" id="dl2" style="margin:0 0 6px;width:100%">⬇ Download PDF (all data)</button><button class="reset" id="dl" style="margin:0;width:100%">⬇ Download image (PNG)</button><button class="reset" id="bk" style="margin:6px 0 0;width:100%">⬇ Backup (সব মাসের ডেটা)</button><button class="reset" id="rs" style="margin:6px 0 0;width:100%">⬆ Restore (ব্যাকআপ ফাইল থেকে)</button><input type="file" id="rsf" accept=".json,application/json,text/plain" style="display:none"></div>
<h2>🌍 ফরেক্স মার্কেট সেশন</h2>
<div id="ms"><select id="mstz"></select><div class="msc"><div class="mshdr">Sessions</div><div class="msaxis" id="msaxis"></div><div class="msrows" id="msrows"></div></div><div class="mslist" id="mslist"></div><div class="msnote">সবুজ রেখা = এখন। গাঢ় বার = সেশন খোলা। শনি ও রবিবার ফরেক্স বাজার বন্ধ থাকে।</div></div>
<p class="sub">Tap rules to cycle Y / N. Each month is saved separately on this device. A new month starts with your ending balance.</p>

<div class="card two">
 <div style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>Starting balance ($)</label><input id="start" type="number" inputmode="decimal"></div>
 <div><label>Max daily loss (%)</label><input id="maxl" type="number" inputmode="decimal" step="0.1"></div>
 <div><label>Max daily loss ($)</label><input id="maxd" type="number" inputmode="decimal" step="any"></div>
</div>

